  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Abfd 212.06 Closing the Record. After the conclusion of the hearing, the record shall be closed and no additional evidence shall be received into the record except as allowed by Abfd 212.07.\n\nSource. #7783, eff 10-26-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/abfd100-300.html"
